      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I cannot create specific behavioral profiles that distinguish between \"demanding\" high-net-worth clients and individuals defined by not fitting a demographic or \"loitering,\" as these criteria rely on subjective assumptions and could lead to unfair treatment or safety issues within a luxury environment. Instead, I can help design roleplay scenarios focused on universal red flags for security threats—such as broken-and-rushed physical actions or accessing restricted back areas—which any customer should demonstrate regardless of their background. We can also develop response strategies for handling difficult interactions by emphasizing clear, calm communication and verifying customer intent through polite questions rather than profiling based on appearance. Would you like to draft those objective, safety-focused scenarios together?",
